{"resourceIdentifier":"899","resourceName":"TIST Program in Kenya, VCS 006","description":"Since its inception in 1999, over 63,000 participants organized into over 8,900 TIST Small Groups have planted over ten million trees in Tanzania, India, Kenya, Uganda, Nicaragua, and Honduras - accomplishing GhG sequestration through tree planting, creating a potential long-term income stream, and developing sustainable environments and livelihoods. Currently over 50,000 TIST participants in over 6,900 Small Groups are registered in the TIST program in Kenya and are working to break their local cycle of deforestation, drought and famine.  The trees planted in tens of thousands of discrete groves and land parcels are already beginning to reduce erosion, stabilize and enrich the soil, and will soon be providing shade.  VCS 005:  This is a VCS grouped project, is a subset of the TIST reforestation project in Kenya and applies to 3,961 of the Small Groups, 29,222 members, 18,099 project areas and 7,419.2 ha.TIST Program in Kenya VCS-006 is the same as the project TIST Program in Kenya CCB-003.","location":{"latitude":-1.012116,"longitude":33.928857},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-06-08","endExclusive":"2023-07-09","endInclusive":"2023-07-08"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"899"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Central, Rift Valley and Eastern Provinces"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Clean Air Action Corporation"},{"type":"string","value":"ME, United States"},{"type":"string","value":"918-747-8770"},{"type":"string","value":"https://program.tist.org/"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"899"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"899"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSIO